{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'scc|bundle|alias-site' src/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/siteset.cljc\"","aggregated_output":"src/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:7:   are bundled into one unit with lazy member bodies and thin member aliases,\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:14:   `:scc-module-specs`  `(fn [registry units runtime-address deps])`\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:17:   `:alias-site-set`    publish empty alias occurrence sets as well, when true\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:98:   `{:status :ok :addresses {name address} :bundles {bundle-symbol address}\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:99:     :sites {name-or-bundle-symbol publication}\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:100:     :binders {name-or-bundle-symbol publication}}`, or the first refusal:\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:103:   may publish its empty set with `:alias-site-set`.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:105:  (let [{:keys [imported-names module-spec scc-module-specs site-set alias-site-set\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:120:                        (scc-module-specs registry (mapv by-name members)\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:124:                bundle (first specs)\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:125:                result (publish-fn handle bundle)\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:146:              (reduced (assoc result :unit (if (vector? step) (str (:name bundle)) step)))\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:149:                ;; bundle. Some frontends publish the alias's empty set too.\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:151:                               (assoc-in [:bundles (:name bundle)] (:address result))\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:152:                               (emit (:name bundle) result (:ast bundle)))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:158:                                                                    {(:name bundle) (:address result)}))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:162:                                                  (if alias-site-set\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:170:                    (emit step result (:ast bundle)))))))\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/publication.cljc:171:        {:status :ok, :addresses {}, :bundles {}}\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/siteset.cljc:127:  [publisher sites addresses bundles]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/siteset.cljc:129:          (signed-entry publisher (or (get addresses k) (get bundles k))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3913:   Options: `:prelude` is `:bundled` (default; the prelude tree ahead of the\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3930:            :or {prelude :bundled}}]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3931:   (when-not (contains? #{:bundled :linked} prelude)\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4110:(defn scc-module-specs\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4112:   indexed exports m0-spec/m0-body, one `phpscc.<members>` bundle followed\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4114:   and read the bundle's own bodies; only `php` and outgoing includes are\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4119:        bundle-name (symbol (str \"phpscc.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4152:        bundle (core-module/module-spec\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4154:                 {:name bundle-name,\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4161:    (core-module/scc-module-specs\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4162:      bundle\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4166:                                        require-profile bundle-name sk bk)))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
