{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"agent_message","text":"The cause is the instrumentation wrapper: it placed the whole module inside a sequencing lambda, so the linker no longer treated its definitions as module-level bindings. I’ve changed the wrapper to sequence the hook and module as module-level operands, preserving the original execution order."}}
