{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_71","type":"agent_message","text":"The remaining issue crosses an architectural boundary: the linker conservatively requires a deferred body’s referenced definition to precede every application site, while tick instrumentation adds calls before the cyclic bundle has defined all member bodies. The attempted wrapper change did not satisfy that rule, so I’ve reverted it and am recording the evidence and the design decision needed, as requested."}}
