{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"The include regression remains unresolved. A focused run reproduced the empty output and traced it to the linker rejecting the cyclic bundle’s `m1-body` reference as `:undeclared-free`; the fixture files and their instrumented site sets publish successfully.\n\nThe linker’s conservative rule for deferred references conflicts with application sites introduced by tick instrumentation. A wrapper change did not resolve the refusal, so I reverted it and stopped at the design boundary as requested. The findings describe the decision needed: [include-fix findings](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/collab/yang-php/1794771821000-engineer-include-fix-r1.codex.findings.md).\n\nThe scoped baseline was manually stopped after approximately 900 seconds without a result. No include or tick suite is claimed green, and lint checks were not run. The findings are committed and pushed on `codex/include-fix-r1` at `797c72b4`; no implementation changes remain."}}
